{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-3670399","kind":"blog","title":"【日记】2016年博多中洲美食","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-05-24","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 博多中洲","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-3670399/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"记录在东京品尝博多中洲本店美食的会餐时光，分享猪肉、牛肉与尾汤的特别吃法。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","日記"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 博多中洲","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3670399.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160527051926id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3670399.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">今天是会餐</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">美味的肉！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">本店在博多中洲的店 @ 东京！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3670399/001-7113ebf386.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3670399/001-7113ebf386.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n凄不凄？！\n肉看起来像蛋糕一样！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3670399/002-d6b6686436.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3670399/002-d6b6686436.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n左边是美味的猪肉！\n右边是美味的牛肉！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n把肉放进中间的\n尾汤里煮熟\n然后吃掉！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n肉和蔬菜的美味组合！\n\n<br>\n\n\n总觉得特别棒！\n\n最高！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n※我试着把肉以外的地方调暗了（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见啦！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">今日は会食で</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">美味しいお肉！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">博多中洲が本店のお店 @ 東京！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3670399/001-7113ebf386.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3670399/001-7113ebf386.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n凄くない？！\nお肉のケーキみたい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3670399/002-d6b6686436.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3670399/002-d6b6686436.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n左は美味しい豚肉！\n右は美味しい牛肉！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n肉を真ん中の\nテールスープに落として\n煮込んで食べるのです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n肉と野菜の美味しいコラボ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n何だかとってもいい感じ！\n\n        最高！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n※肉以外は暗くしてみました（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}